-- ALTER of an existing source table through the facade: rejected
TABLE_IS_PERMANENTLY_READ_ONLY
-- ALTER of a missing source table through the facade: the same error (no existence oracle)
TABLE_IS_PERMANENTLY_READ_ONLY
-- ALTER through a facade over an unreachable source: still the same error, not the connection error
TABLE_IS_PERMANENTLY_READ_ONLY
-- UPDATE of an existing source table through the facade: rejected
TABLE_IS_PERMANENTLY_READ_ONLY
-- UPDATE of a missing source table through the facade: the same error (no existence oracle)
TABLE_IS_PERMANENTLY_READ_ONLY
-- UPDATE through a facade over an unreachable source: still the same error, not the connection error
TABLE_IS_PERMANENTLY_READ_ONLY
-- ALTER and UPDATE in the underlying database keep working
